    "title": "R6 — PM layer",
    "description": "Outcome: sessions start from the board and end on it; milestones open with an outcome and close with an audit and a release; every backlog item carries its unblock condition or gets closed. Scope: the PM layer on gh alone, for sidekick and furnace — sidekick pm, sk-orient, sk-track, sk-milestone, bootstrap. Order: seat → bootstrap → orient ‖ track → milestone. Sized to two sessions; if it runs over, groom splits out of sk-milestone rather than the milestone stretching. Closes with 0.3.0. Design: docs/reviews/2026-09-18-pm-layer-survey.md and docs/reviews/2026-09-19-pm-layer-research-round.md.",
